The text is a joint advisory and technical clarification from the State Cyber Protection Centre of SSSCIP, the Cyber Security Situation Centre of the SBU, and Cloudflare Inc. concerning the public exposure of real IP addresses of Ukrainian government and critical infrastructure web resources. It clarifies that DNS lookups and WHOIS queries routinely reveal origin IP addresses unless systems behind CDN/DDoS protection proxies like Cloudflare are configured to route all traffic properly, and points to Cloudflare and CERT-UA security guidelines.

